{A.1 = 1-16}
11=1.	I shall greet her who ascends above, her who ascends above, I shall greet the Mistress who ascends above, I shall greet the great lady of heaven, @wDN{Inana}! I shall greet the holy torch who fills the heavens, the light, @wDN{Inana}, her who shines like daylight, the great lady of heaven, @wDN{Inana}! I shall greet the Mistress, the most awesome lady among the @wDN{Anuna} gods; the respected one who fills heaven and earth with her huge brilliance; the eldest daughter of @wDN{Suen}, @wDN{Inana}! For the young lady I shall sing a song about her grandeur, about her greatness, about her exalted dignity; about her radiantly ascending at evening; about her filling the heaven like a holy torch; about her stance in the heavens, as noticeable by all lands, from the south to the highlands, as that of @wDN{Nanna} or of @wDN{Utu}; about the greatness of the mistress of heaven! 

